{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "33c119925828282813dbdffb01a76599d0d4edcb3aacab763e5b63fede914c76", "ja": "（可奈がリレーのアンカーを務めることになった。\n本番に向けて、今日もふたりで特訓だ！）", "zh": "（可奈要担任接力赛的最后一棒。为了迎接正式比赛，今天也要和她一起特训！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "53e57ccf0d46e65d641e31370dbd1fa65ae061a9bfaeb0406addbd49a96222ac", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……。\nた、タイム、どうですか……？", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……  \n那、那个，成绩怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1dd7efdf38ce5ec710d6d710704fc1f2732f19d137014a2dd5e355b74cc0d24d", "ja": "かなり良くなってきたぞ！　\n最初の頃と比べて、10秒以上もタイムが縮んでるな。", "zh": "已经进步很大了！  \n和刚开始相比，用时缩短了10秒以上呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "3992b6eabbcd2dca396b26f97f7ed196a26e8d3f8aca55ed634700458591d14c", "ja": "本当ですか！　えへへ、特訓の成果が出てきましたね♪\nよ～し、この調子でどんどんタイムあげていくぞ～！", "zh": "真的吗！嘿嘿，特训的成果开始显现了呢♪\n好——，照这个势头继续不断刷新成绩吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9613ee11b1231a203eb8f42ba4a6d35524fb7e90599d1955e414510903e5e297", "ja": "特訓はいいけど、無理してないか？\n通常のレッスンをこなして、特訓まで……。", "zh": "特训是好事，可你是不是有点勉强自己了？完成日常课程后，还要进行特训……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "3e76af9cf95d8f1291322a3c7e35f3394d3bb358aff6dacea5fd09e1119ce4e8", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、へっちゃらです♪\nアイドルになって、体力はずいぶんつきましたし。", "zh": "没事的，完全小菜一碟♪\n当上偶像之后，我的体力已经长进很多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "36b2e31d765f81dea6ee386b537e89e3ec145f34fe4e7106aeef4863a200f73a", "ja": "それに、アンカーを任されたからには、みんなの期待に\n応えなきゃって。私、気合い十分なんです♪", "zh": "而且既然把最后一棒交给了我，我就一定要回应大家的期待。  \n我可是干劲十足呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1007_p", "source_sha256": "90762beca047a08a62774263aa3e99809115fbef5699f432782580d41833d494", "ja": "わかった。そこまで言うなら全力でサポートするよ。\nなにかして欲しいことがあったら遠慮なく言ってくれ！", "zh": "明白了。既然你都说到这个份上了，我也会全力支持你的。\n要是有什么需要我做的，尽管开口！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "a379f6b05238cfaffe9d7b2929c44ea33a873f6b29cad330e66b1fc4f4a906e0", "ja": "して欲しいこと……あ、それなら\n私のために応援ソングを考えて欲しいですっ！", "zh": "想让我做的事……啊，那就请为我写一首加油歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1009_p", "source_sha256": "51321a5d1d7ac9fcbb125f52860db61a4ef02534da12ed963468f1a04f51d843", "ja": "応援ソング？", "zh": "加油歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "baf898079299f552a1096a4dcde0b61cad7c15f8f420c5e33677a69d975dca19", "ja": "はいっ！　{$P$}さんの応援って、\nすっごくパワーをもらえるんです！", "zh": "是的！{$P$}先生的加油声，\n能给我带来超强的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "b74a20fdbd7718c1b49be38dbb76eef3c22b10de1f68b4cc3e813a8cdbfc72ca", "ja": "その応援に歌が付いたら……\n私、もっともっとがんばれる気がするんです♪", "zh": "如果那份加油声能配上歌曲……\n我感觉自己一定能更加努力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0bc0e0b07ebb3871754084ba303091c360862449939667a703646d4d17afff6a", "ja": "なるほどな。応援歌か……。\nでも歌は素人だから、上手に歌えるかわからないぞ？", "zh": "原来如此，是应援歌啊……\n不过我不懂唱歌，也不知道能不能唱好哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "a876cb0809e8acbdae1439a6d1f161ca7462a903b418dc1f34bc6854355bbadd", "ja": "うまいとか関係ないです！　気持ちを込めることが\n大事だって。いつも言ってるじゃないですか！", "zh": "唱得好不好不重要！重要的是要投入感情，这不是我一直都在说的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "189dc73a9eaa07f66414d212b4227b402d7b8e6b8e5f2fb520f9a0fa1aac5428", "ja": "{$P$}さんが応援してくれる……。\n私、それだけで嬉しいんです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生能为我加油……\n只要这样，我就已经很高兴了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1015_p", "source_sha256": "94c8c9dcc990cf597d64910511af9832d11548367e2ed56610ed60594a51a22f", "ja": "そうか……。それじゃ可奈が一周してくる間に\n頑張って考えてみるよ。可奈を応援する歌をな。", "zh": "这样啊……那就趁可奈绕一圈回来的这段时间，\n我努力想想吧。想一首为可奈加油的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "cc04ab092e7f05222482fa0b4335ca450c43f585119d0305d58476f9c839c1c3", "ja": "やった～♪　{$P$}さんの応援～♪\nもらったら、元気百倍～♪", "zh": "太好啦～♪　得到了{$P$}先生的加油～♪\n立刻就精神百倍啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0383_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "2c21e90c3534b50a8a740beedc8d4655a061da2c06e41a19eaada71b4a889b13", "ja": "楽しみにしてますね、{$P$}さん！\nそれじゃ、私、走ってきまーす♪", "zh": "我很期待哦，{$P$}先生！\n那么，我先跑步去了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
